# WARP-LATTICE: Warp Bend 90 degrees curls a tall subdivided Box; Lattice moves the front centre control point and bulges a second Box
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Width 40
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Depth 40
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Height 160
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.WidthSubdivisions 4
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.DepthSubdivisions 4
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.HeightSubdivisions 16
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 100,120,420
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.1,-1
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Когда run Modeling "Deform tool: Warp"
Когда run Modeling "Warp operation: Bend"
Когда --subject modeling set Warp.BendDegrees 90
Тогда-вид 0_bend the tall box is bent into a quarter arc
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 200,0,0
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 200,80,300
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Когда run Modeling "Deform tool: Lattice"
Когда --subject modeling set Lattice.XAxisResolution 3
Когда --subject modeling set Lattice.YAxisResolution 3
Когда --subject modeling set Lattice.ZAxisResolution 3
Когда run Modeling "Lattice: pick control point at the viewport centre"
Тогда-вид 1_picked the lattice cage over the second box, its front centre point yellow (selected) with the gizmo on it
Когда --subject modeling set Lattice.GizmoZ 100
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 380,140,260
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.6,-0.2,-0.77
Тогда-вид 2_bulge from the side: the second box's front face bulges out toward +Z in the middle
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда 3_accepted both deformed boxes stay deformed, no tool bar
